@{ViewData["Title"]="Enter race results";var rows=ViewBag.Enrolments as JsonArray??new JsonArray();var results=ViewBag.Results as JsonArray??new JsonArray();}<h1 class="section-title">Race results</h1><p class="text-secondary">Record finish times and positions after the event.</p><div class="card p-3 mb-3"><h5>Enrolled participants</h5><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Participant</th><th>Category</th><th>Finish time</th><th>Position</th><th>Save result</th></tr></thead><tbody>@foreach(var r in rows){<tr><td>@(r?["user"]?["fullName"])</td><td>@(r?["category"]?["name"])</td><td colspan="3"><form asp-action="SaveResult" method="post" class="row g-2"><input type="hidden" name="eventId" value="@ViewBag.EventId"/><input type="hidden" name="EnrolmentID" value="@(r?["enrolmentID"])"/><div class="col-md-4"><input name="FinishTime" type="time" step="1" class="form-control" required/></div><div class="col-md-3"><input name="Position" type="number" min="1" class="form-control" placeholder="Position" required/></div><div class="col-md-3"><button class="btn btn-race btn-sm">Publish</button></div></form></td></tr>}</tbody></table></div></div><div class="card p-3"><h5>Published results</h5>@foreach(var r in results){<div class="border-bottom py-2">@(r?["enrolment"]?["user"]?["fullName"]) — @(r?["finishTime"]) — position @(r?["position"])</div>}@if(results.Count==0){<div class="empty">No results have been published yet.</div>}</div>